<title>TUNISIA: Arafat arrives in Tunisia to brief president.</title>
<headline>Arafat arrives in Tunisia to brief president.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Palestinian President Yasser Arafat arrived in Tunis on Thursday to brief President Zine al-Abidine Ben Ali on this week's Middle East summit in Washington.</p>
<p>He made no statement on arrival.</p>
<p>PLO sources said Arafat would meet Ben Ali on Friday.</p>
</text>
